# MQTT ACL on sv01 (phase 2, 2026-10-30; zendure added 2026-10-30)
# homey: only the homey/ topic tree (publishes telemetry, consumes commands)
# hermes: full control (sv01-side automation, cron jobs, monitoring)
# zendure: the SolarFlow 2400 AC+ when its app is pointed at this broker
#          (local MQTT mode) — telemetry out, control commands in for sv01
user homey
topic readwrite homey/#

user hermes
topic readwrite #

user zendure
topic readwrite zendure/#